WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.650
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.160
And that's the end of today's 
"We are FuwaFuwa Dreamers"! {I guess they're precure}

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.570
Did you all have fun?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.950
We'll be waiting for you next week, same time, same channel.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.710
Bye-bye!

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.250
They were as cute as always.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.300
Right? Double muses are great!

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.970
Wasn't that so much fun?

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:39.100
Yes, it was. And I'm just happy that our viewers feel the same way.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:43.770
Kirara?

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:48.560
Ako-chan, I need a once-in-a-lifetime favor.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.660
Form a unit with Kirara for this event!

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.380
Come on, please!

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.510
I wanna enter with you!

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:40.430
And why exactly does it have to be me?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:43.510
Unlike you, I happen to be busy.

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.140
Saying that is baa!

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.640
Hey, let's enter the Unit Cup!

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:55.020
"Passionate bond with your partner"...

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:58.740
I couldn't possibly show my face at such an embarrassing event!

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:02.910
But this event doles out lots of points.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.330
Points?

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.790
For the Aikatsu Ranking!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:11.790
You get points every time you do a show, 
and the more you get, the higher your rank! {I didn't realize until now that Ako wasn't doing it. also Kirara explains how it works before remembering Ako wasn't in it...}{Aikatsu characters are probably conditioned to explain everything regardless}

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:14.340
That has nothing to do with me.

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:19.420
Oh, right. You never signed up for the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:22.970
I'm focusing entirely on my acting work.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:28.680
Kirara's gonna make it to the Final Tournament and make Elza-sama proud!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.230
Tournament?

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:38.570
The Final Tournament is the ultimate competition to decide who tops the Aikatsu Ranking at the end of the year! {this makes no sense unless the tournament gives you more points than everything else, elza's already too far ahead}{it could just be an american-style league-sports-format-esque regular-season-into-playoffs-type deal}

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.820
But to qualify for it, you need to be one of the top four idols.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:46.620
Huh, that's rather exclusive.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.910
They take a snapshot of the rankings at the end of January.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:54.500
If you haven't made it by then, then too baa for you.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.590
Aren't you in second right now? Even without this—

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.760
Baa! That's naïve, Ako-chan!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:05.430
December and January are packed full of big events worth tons of points!

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:10.390
I'll never ask you for anything else again! Please enter the event with me!

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.900
I understand where you're coming from.

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:20.030
But that has no weight in the matter. 
Say what you may, but I will still refuse.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.030
No way!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:24.860
Hey, hold on. What's going on, you two?

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.620
Yume.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.950
What, that's all?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.580
Why not just go along with her? I want to see you two together.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:36.210
That's easy for you to say.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:40.000
Then you'd be fine if I went with another girl?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.090
Yes, please feel free.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.970
You liar! Kirara would feel baa with anyone other than Ako-chan!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.350
Aren't you the same?

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:52.100
Baa? Baa baa? {yes, I did check}

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:55.810
Oh, fine.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:05:00.730
Yay! Let's show everyone our hot and passionate bond!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:08.740
The wait is over! It's time to start the preliminary round of the Kira Kira Unit Cup!

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:14.870
Our contestants will have to pass several stages to demonstrate their unit's bonds.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:20.840
At the end, five units chosen by popular vote will proceed to the finals.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.760
I didn't do this just to get eliminated here.{hey, gurren lagann taught me a word}

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:25.720
Yeah!

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:31.390
First up is the "Do you get me?" quiz!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:35.520
Please write down your partner's favorite thing on your boards.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.810
Ako-chan's favorite thing?

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.020
Ah, I've got it!

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:40.980
Done!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.900
Hanazono Kirara-san, go for it!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.280
That Subaru-kyun boy!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.530
What are you writing?!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.410
Next up is the in-sync challenge!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.040
A little more right.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.790
No, to the left.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:02.380
Which unit will be able to eat their soft serve most cleanly, helping-hand style?{it annoys me greatly that people don't hyphenate soft-serve}

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.920
Oh, let's just do it! There!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.010
Kirara!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:10.260
I couldn't see anything!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:16.180
Lastly is the "How much do you like me?" contest!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:24.280
Stand in front of your mic and shout what you like best about your partner as loudly as you can!

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.440
Her...

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:28.650
Her kindness!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:35.200
D-Doing something like this would be unfathomable!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.460
Aw, why's that?

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.170
Just say what you honestly think!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.460
Come on, we're up next!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.960
I don't want to!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:49.090
I really love how Ako-chan is kind at heart, 
but always says the opposite of what she thinks!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.100
Next is Saotome Ako-san.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.260
Go on!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:05.190
I-I don't care for Hanazono Kirara in the least.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.990
Not the way she's always sincere and straightforward...

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:11.240
And definitely not how she's unexpectedly resolute!

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:15.030
Is Kirara being praised?

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.950
Quite a lot, at that.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:19.660
She's such a contrarian!

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.290
Congratulations!

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:28.300
It's amazing that you got the most votes in the first round!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.800
Well, that was the natural outcome...

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:34.430
Everyone says that watching your exchanges made them feel warm and fuzzy.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.810
Thank you.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.310
Hey, look at this.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:44.150
After watching the preliminary round, we decided to form a unit too! {I didn't really think much about it, but they totally just found random fans on the street to interview}{they stand out, at least}

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:47.320
We're keeping our eyes on Ako-chan and Kirara-chan!

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.780
How cute!

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:54.870
I used to do that too, stuff like imitating my favorite rock idol's hairstyle.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.450
We all did.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:01.080
That broadcast gained you both a lot of fans.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:05.460
Listen, Elza-sama!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:09.840
I got through the prelims of a big event today!

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.340
I see.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:15.300
I'm gonna do my bestest for you, okay?{is this really necesse}

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:20.890
Kirara, from now on you are to do whatever Aikatsu you please.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.980
You've provided me with more than enough radiance.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:28.190
Elza-sama?

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:43.250
We have one week until the Unit Cup finals.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.620
Honestly...

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.130
What am I to do with her?

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.760
I have to work hard.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:57.800
What's gotten into you?

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:01.140
It's strange for you to make so many missteps.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.980
Elza-sama's the one acting strange.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.650
She's not watching me anymore.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:10.570
Do my ears deceive me? 
What happened to your drive?

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:13.190
But, she...

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:18.820
Tell me, Hanazono Kirara—Why in the world are you doing Aikatsu?

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:23.080
Well obviously, I want Elza-sama to praise me.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:28.670
Are your feelings that weak?

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:34.970
If you truly want her to see you, do everything you can to make her turn your way!

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:40.050
If I try my hardest, will Elza-sama look at me?

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:41.970
Yes, without question.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:45.020
Got it! I'll do my best!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:19.340
Hey, Ako-chan. Can we go through it one more time?

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.640
Sure thing...

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:30.980
Ako-chan? Ako-chan!

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.440
Ako-chan! {SNAAAAAAKE}

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:48.290
Don't do it, Ako-chan! Dying is baa!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:53.540
How could I possibly die with you shouting like that?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:58.670
Goodness, I'm ashamed of myself for passing out.

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:03.180
Don't say that! You pushed yourself because I asked you.

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:07.680
Why... why would you go so far?

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:12.560
I'm where am I now because others have supported me.

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:20.070
Everyone has times when they feel down and don't know what to do.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:24.740
But there are people who will accept you and prop you back up.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:31.370
Don't worry. We're double muses, aren't we?

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.290
Ako-chan...

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.880
Yeah, thanks!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.300
I apologize for keeping you.

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.890
Let's do this!

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.640
Are you sure you're better?

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:52.270
Yes. I hope you didn't slack off while I was out.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.520
I didn't!

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:57.570
Very good! The work's just getting started.

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:01.860
Okay! Kirara's gonna work hard for Elza-sama!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.030
Ako-chan?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:08.240
You needn't mind me.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:11.580
Here we go, let's do it!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:14.120
Aikatsu!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:34.690
I'm beat.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.560
We worked up quite the sweat.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.690
The event's tomorrow.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:43.570
I'm thinking of inviting Elza-sama tonight.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:45.320
You think she'll come?

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.990
There's no need to fret so long as your feelings get through.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.290
Yeah! Thanks!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.080
Elza-sama!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:58.710
I really, really want you to come watch me at tomorrow's event.{generally I'm for capitalizing these things but are you really sure about this one}{just a typo mang}

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.090
I promise I'll win!

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:05.380
I'll consider it.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:07.260
Really? Yay!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:10.810
I'm super excited to have you come!

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:14.480
Ouch!

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.020
So tomorrow's the Unit Cup.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:21.230
Yes.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.740
I couldn't be more prepared.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.200
And yet you're making that face?

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:37.250
Every person has their own reason for doing Aikatsu.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:43.130
Kirara is doing it for Elza-san, and that in itself is not necessarily bad.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.630
Yeah.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:49.970
I used to be the same way, simply admiring Subaru-kyun and wishing he would look my way.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:53.430
But now I'm certain that isn't good enough.

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:54.730
I agree.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:57.600
You also need to Aikatsu for your fans, right?

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:04.650
Kirara is loved by many and has fans all over the world. {I kind of wanted to include some reference to how she has a large demographic of people who like her}

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:08.530
Am I being overbearing trying to change her?

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.740
Kirara-chan means a lot to you.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:14.040
It's not like I...

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:20.710
This will be the one time I expect you to be fully honest and say exactly what you mean to her.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:23.880
Yume.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:31.100
Welcome to the finals of the Kira Kira Unit Cup.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:37.230
The winners will be decided by your votes after each group gets a chance to perform.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:42.650
Which unit will show us the most passionate bond of all?

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:48.530
We're up first after the opening ceremony.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:51.320
Yeah! Let's win for sure!

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.240
No need to say it twice.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.500
Come to think of it, is Elza-san here?

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:59.410
She must be nice and comfy by now!

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:06.050
Why?

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.050
She wasn't there?

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:12.930
I worked hard, but she still didn't look my way...

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:16.890
She's never going to watch me ever again!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:21.310
Kirara!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.490
Elza-sama—

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.200
Of course it wouldn't be her.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.710
She's probably already decided to—{at first I wasn't sure about this but I guess I'm well, actually I'm still not sure about this, but}

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.420
You mustn't cry!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:44.920
But...

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.430
Why... why are you crying?

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.800
I'm upset.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:55.850
Huh?

00:15:56.310 --> 00:16:00.980
I know just how amazing you are, so much that it hurts.

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:04.480
That's what makes me so upset and angry at you!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:11.490
There's more to you than just being someone for Elza-san to watch over. {wow I was in a just mood}

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:16.910
Have you ever considered how many fans you have out there?

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:17.660
Huh?

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.830
Look at that.

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.090
There are so many Ako-chan and Kiraras. {I'd like to write around this}{if you're letting her keep her third person and stuff, this should the same kind of thing doesn't?}{I meant the plural}

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:40.470
They all love you, look up to you, 
and want to be a little closer to you.{"literal" but usefully vague}

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:44.230
Everyone is watching you, and of course,

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.560
that includes me.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:49.820
Yeah!

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.490
Saotome Ako, making a dazzling entrance!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:17:00.120
Come have a fluffy sweet dream with Kirara!

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:45.260
Now, all five units have performed.

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:48.850
Let's tally up the votes.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.020
Ready, and...

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:52.600
Start!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:02.150
The winners are Hanazono Kirara and Saotome Ako!

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.650
We won!

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.740
Wow! This is awesome, Ako-chan!

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:08.030
Yes!

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:11.870
Congratulations on your victory, you two.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:15.210
How are you feeling right now? 
Please give us a short comment.

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.880
You know, there's something Kirara learned today.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:29.930
Even without Elza-sama, I can still stand on stage together with Ako-chan no matter what.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:34.180
With her, I can definitely show you my best performance.

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:38.060
For all of my fans who are watching me!

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:41.900
Everyone, thanks so much for today!

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.570
Kirara...

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:49.200
Isn't doing Aikatsu for your fans fun?

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:56.370
Kirara wants to have way more sweet dreams with Ako-chan!

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:02.050
We'll continue to dream together from now on, whether I want to or not.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:04.970
Ako-chan!

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:13.100
I really do love those two.

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:15.350
Yeah, me too.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:19.310
I can see them shining even brighter from now on.

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:21.480
We can't let them leave us behind.

00:23:55.990 --> 00:24:01.410
Wearing matching coords let me put on my best performances ever!

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:04.540
Let's go on for all the fans cheering us on!

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:09.010
We'll keep working hard at Aikatsu and share more fluffy sweet dreams!

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:13.970
Everyone shine! I really love this theme.

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:14.970
An audition?

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:18.310
I want lots of people to hear my new song.

00:24:18.310 --> 00:24:20.640
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.640 --> 00:24:22.060
Share in the Radiance.

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.350
Become the first-star idol!
